WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.869
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.537
How's everybody doing tonight?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.106
Good to hear.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:07.640
In that case,
let's get to the news.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.243
President Biden spoke from the
White House on Tuesday

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.678
and asked when the country
will be ready to

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:14.247
stand up to the gun lobby.

00:00:14.247 --> 00:00:15.648
When we will?

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.183
That's like your landlord
saying,

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:20.019
"Ooh, you got to do
something about these mice."

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.521
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:24.724
The White House announced -- has
announced that the K-Pop group

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:27.326
BTS will appear next week
with President Biden

00:00:27.326 --> 00:00:29.929
because the White House
is always looking for ways

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:33.165
to make Biden look even older.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:33.165 --> 00:00:34.367
I mean, look at that.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.504
That's like a Korean
remake of "Scooby Doo."

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:38.804
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.804 --> 00:00:40.573
"I would have gotten away with
it if it weren't for

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:44.043
these pesky kids
and their catchy hooks."

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:45.278
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.278 --> 00:00:47.880
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:50.283
said in a new interview that
he's never heard

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.152
former President Trump say
that the 2020 election

00:00:53.152 --> 00:00:54.453
was stolen from him.

00:00:54.453 --> 00:00:56.389
Even more troubling,
he also said,

00:00:56.389 --> 00:00:59.058
"Who is this Herschel Walker
I keep hearing about?"

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:00.826
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:02.928
Herschel Walker said that he's
never heard Trump say

00:01:02.928 --> 00:01:04.563
that the 2020 election
was stolen,

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:06.599
which is kind of like saying
you've never heard

00:01:06.599 --> 00:01:08.467
Flo talk about Progressive.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:12.572
I've never heard her talk about
anything else.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.173
Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.308
won this week's
Republican primary

00:01:16.308 --> 00:01:18.545
in Georgia's
14th Congressional district.

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:21.614
But just for fun, she's going
to storm the Capitol anyway.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:26.285
[ Laughter ]
It's a celebration storm!

00:01:26.285 --> 00:01:29.121
MSNBC announced this week
that former White House

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:32.291
Press Secretary Jen Psaki will
host a new streaming show.

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:34.493
Well, let's hope
"White House to NBC"

00:01:34.493 --> 00:01:36.696
goes better than
"NBC to the White House."

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:41.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.003
A romance novelist --
alright.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:45.772
[ Laughter ]
No one rememb--

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.106
I don't remember
what show that was.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:48.374
It could've been on any
network.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.076
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.076 --> 00:01:53.813
A romance novelist in Oregon
who wrote a book -- excuse me.

00:01:53.813 --> 00:01:57.349
A romance novelist in Oregon
who wrote a blog post titled

00:01:57.349 --> 00:01:59.752
"How to Murder Your Husband"
was convicted yesterday

00:01:59.752 --> 00:02:02.021
of killing her husband.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:05.024
In case you're wondering how far
you have to go to get someone

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:09.996
to read a blog post.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.598
According to a new survey,
41% of Americans

00:02:12.598 --> 00:02:15.067
said that their largest single
monthly expense

00:02:15.067 --> 00:02:18.905
is rent or mortgage,
and one said dinosaur skulls.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:22.308
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.577
Amtrak this week released
pictures of its new

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.880
Acela trains, which will feature
contactless restrooms.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:30.483
Well, contactless
depending on your balance.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:36.288
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.288 --> 00:02:37.457
Walking down one of those
is like

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.158
walking down
an old rope bridge.

00:02:39.158 --> 00:02:40.526
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:43.729
And finally a plaster cast
of the late singer

00:02:43.729 --> 00:02:46.632
Jimi Hendrix's penis is set to
be unveiled next month

00:02:46.632 --> 00:02:49.102
at the phallological museum
in Iceland,

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:52.171
which houses the world's largest
display of penises.

00:02:52.171 --> 00:02:54.440
It costs adults
10 bucks to enter,

00:02:54.440 --> 00:03:02.681
while members get in free.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:02.681 --> 00:03:04.216
He wrote --
he writes in my voice.

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:06.452
That's what I like about him.

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:07.687
You guys,
that was the monologue.

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:09.055
How are you feeling?
[ Cheers and applause ]

